<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
Generic table sub-report. The first row of the JRBeanCollectionDataSource is the header row (header=true).
Each column has a String cell (cN) and a Number twin (nN) at the same position; a row fills exactly one of them, so they never
overlap. Only the XLSX export fills nN, so spreadsheet cells are real numbers (SUM/sort work); PDF/DOCX keep the pre-formatted text.
Data only from JRBeanCollectionDataSource (AC-36): there is no query. Columns beyond the table width are null and not printed.
-->
